{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39680","headline":"下第东归留辞刑部郑郎中諴 · 黄滔","name":"下第东归留辞刑部郑郎中諴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"去违知己住违亲，欲发羸蹄进退频。\n万里家山归养志，数年门馆受恩身。\n莺声历历秦城晓，柳色依依灞水春。\n明日蓝田关外路，连天风雨一行人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"黄滔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39680.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39680","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}